WEBVTT

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.190
We are in the clear.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.540
The mechanical phoenixes' carrier approaches. Over.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.800
Proceed forward.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.490
We need only to sink or seize the enemy battleship

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.090
to fulfill the criteria for winning the battle!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.640
The first mechanical phoenix is taking off.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.330
Are they going to pull the aircraft carrier back once all the mechanical phoenixes have launched?

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:37.560
Margot!

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.430
Malga?!

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.350
I had the half-dragon give me a lift.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.130
Here you go.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.620
It's a good thing this didn't break.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:50.890
It means we should keep fighting, Margot!

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:53.370
We'll sink that carrier and its mechanical phoenixes!

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:54.750
Malga...

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.250
I received an interesting message on my way here.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.960
Perhaps it's because the M.H.R.R. is nearby.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.220
Edel Brocken?!

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.970
Margot, it's no longer about one of us helping the other,

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:12.020
it's all about doing this together now.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:15.730
Let's soar together as witches of the sky!

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:19.450
Verwandlung!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.190
I hereby make a contract to the newly constructed Frauen summon!

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.070
Weisse Frauen!

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.870
I summon you, Schwarze Frauen!

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.420
To me, Weisse Frauen!

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.820
Zwei Frauen: Complete!

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.160
I gotta catch up!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.670
I have no idea what's going on, Malga, but this is incredible! Let's go!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.950
It lets me make spatial drawings!

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.090
This is cutting edge!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.370
The acceleration's boosted by an internal explosion

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.300
which further boosts the semi anti-warcraft magic cannon.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.560
Herrlich!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.030
Let's go after the mechanical phoenix that have taken off!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.470
Zwei Frauen Model II: Fusion Complete!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.420
Coming through!

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.470
Press down on me more!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.930
Is there too much air resistance?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.060
I just like the feel of your breasts pressing into my face.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.750
Herrlich!

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.240
Oopsies...

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.340
It would appear that you suffered from poor mileage.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.330
That explains the rapid depletion of the initial fueling. Over.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:53.250
We have just about completed cleaning up the chaff.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.260
We should take a stable defensive position when appropr—

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.460
Musashi, increase elevation for all ships!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:02.140
Increasing altitude. Over.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.560
I was afraid that they might catch on,

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.070
but if we sink it ourselves before they can capture it,

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.220
they won't meet the criteria to win.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.730
We will commence the attack on their rear.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.550
Direct our cannon fire upon Musashi.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:33.040
If we can position our main fleet directly behind them,

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.540
Musashi cannot force us into a running battle.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.750
They will have no choice but to admit defeat.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.060
Musashi has two paths to victory.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.940
The first is to secure the remnants of the aircraft carrier

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.560
and claim we cleared the criteria needed to win.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.400
The second is to relinquish all rights to the British fleet

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.060
and let them continue the fight in our stead.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.930
However we'd have to negotiate for the former,

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.950
while the latter would raise doubts over Musashi's capacity for war.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:05.070
So we're damned if we do, damned if we don't.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.220
What on Earth should we do...?

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.810
I have to figure this one out on my own, don't I?

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:18.300
Huh?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:37.950
Huh?

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.690
That should be... exciting.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.820
Y-You're brave without trying to be...

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.030
Uh, everyone!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.290
I need a favor!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.290
Isn't that...

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.270
a stealth barrier?!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.000
Are they planning to escape this airspace,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.510
thereby resigning from the Spanish Armada battle?!

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.510
Musashi can't have made it that far in its current state.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.430
It should reappear momentarily.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.810
All personnel, stay vigilant.

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.460
Fire on sight!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:10.060
Tes!

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.310
I detect a ship beneath us!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:20.270
Do they plan to claim the aircraft carrier while in stealth mode?

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:30.220
That ship!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.300
It's a cargo ship?

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.750
A large flying object has appeared above us!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.630
Vertical? Is it going...

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:48.590
Are they going to pull a back-flip while in the air?!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.730
Masazumi!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.940
Miriam, are you okay?!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.760
If by ill luck my desk breaks loose,

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.010
I'll be crushed to death.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:07.450
Mama, are you okay?

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.630
You see, another woman slept with Daddy,

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.580
so Mama is going to die.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.620
L-Let's put that topic to rest!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.930
You said, "Just have sex with me!" as you pounded on the door.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.950
They're going to lock you away now.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.920
Could you quit saying that with disgust?

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:27.940
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.450
It's okay.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.490
Come embrace this child together with me.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.730
You may wrap your legs around me.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.280
No, but—

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:39.850
It is okay!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.430
You have my consent.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.470
We're taking the San Martin from behind!

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.700
Chancellor! Viceroy Horizon!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.970
If you please.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:18.770
Turn around!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:32.060
Master Tori, I desire victory in this battle.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:35.250
That is because I now possess a reason to win.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.310
So you're finally the same as me now.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.460
Go, Lypē Katarripsi.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.740
Halt the unleashed Deadly Sin!

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:12.130
Let me steal some of the limelight.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.410
Taka!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.410
Yeah!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.380
Go!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.890
Boo-yah!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.230
Looks like they're pushing us back.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.680
There's only one alternative.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.450
I just received this from Master Neshinbara via Master Urquiaga.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.440
Oh!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.190
An Armament of Deadly Sins!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.910
Aspida Philargia?!

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:57.160
For its super-drive,

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:01.670
it converts the various attacks dealt to the user into ether and stores it,

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:03.940
thus turning it into the user's internal combustion energy.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:04.840
Say what?

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:08.440
Does it mean you won't need this little Energizer Bunny anymore?

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.930
Who is stupid enough to use their back-up battery first?

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.460
I'm using this only after I've wrung you dry.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.680
Damn it! She corrected me!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.820
Master Tori, it would appear that Aspida Philargia is not set to supply ether

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:27.100
to high-output armaments such as an Armament of Deadly Sins.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.570
For it to supply ether to an Armament of Deadly Sins,

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:34.950
I speculate it requires me to pass Level 3 Security: Soul Activation.

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.750
Soul Activation?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.120
Once I obtain the emotion "avarice,"

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:43.950
I believe I will become a difficult woman for you, Master Tori.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.960
Shall I activate it anyway?

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:55.670
Don't worry.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.800
I'll always be here for you.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.090
That's what I've decided.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.650
You'll never be a pain.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.800
Master Tori...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.890
Huh, what?! What could it be?!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.560
I will only say this once.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.560
I do not comprehend emotions.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:16.070
But I conclude that it is simply a matter of me not understanding them.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.320
But...

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.290
I don't like not understanding, Master Tori!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.120
That's cool!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.040
Let's want for more, Horizon!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.930
Judge.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.080
Horizon, don't forget.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.320
You've already had desires.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.920
You desire to fight... to save.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.170
That avarice will rescue this world.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.820
In that case, Master Tori,

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.280
let's merge together and double everything.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.700
We shall bring the world twice the pain

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:55.790
and twice the salvation.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.890
No matter how the people stand up against us,

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:00.940
no matter how we hurt each other,

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.230
I will be satisfied if that allows us

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.420
to save the world from loss.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.740
That is my avarice.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.330
I desire for eternal happiness and an end to all sorrow,

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.940
let my avarice reach beyond the horizon.

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.850
The second San Martin warship!

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.650
It stopped?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.520
Let's win!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.400
Let's win this together!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.110
Our target: Musashi!

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:56.570
Eh?

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:58.320
Fire!

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.370
Mary Stuart!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:08.040
No, she'd be a Tudor for me.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.790
Thank you very much.

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:14.360
Master Tenzo, please hold me in place.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.300
Judge!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.990
Excalibur Collbrande, please protect those

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.440
that I will grow to hold dear!

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.400
Master Mary...

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:39.700
Yes...

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:47.510
We hereby declare the reenactment of the Spanish Armada battle

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:50.330
between England and Tres España over!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.340
"How do you perceive this outcome?"

00:14:53.340 --> 00:15:00.470
"Musashi has proven that it possesses the ability necessary
to fulfill the wishes of its Chancellor/President and Princess."

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.980
"Or is that an oversimplification?"

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:10.480
You don't say...

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:20.620
In other words, you could say that the novice actors have
finally taken the stage for our play where we repeat history.

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:26.110
And as actors with actual roles to play no less!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.840
It is not over.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.350
It has begun anew, Chancellor.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.320
You think so?

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.010
Henares!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.710
Henares!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.110
Henares!

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:58.210
It's Falles... But why?

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:02.450
It goes to show that we have friends.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.870
Let's spend what money we have left.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.030
Let's just get caught up in the excitement,

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:08.890
enjoy the festival and let go of the rest.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:13.750
Segundo! Segundo! Segundo! Segundo!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:18.530
"...let go of the rest."

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:20.630
That's just your attempt at bravado, isn't it?

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:27.390
Neither of us, nor Gin as she is now, nor anyone else, can possibly let this go.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:32.650
In that case, do not get caught up in the excitement of the festival to forget,

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:38.910
but to believe that there are better days to come.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:52.200
A bonfire on top of the ship?

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:55.220
How does that work in terms of historical reenactments, Musashi?

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:58.790
Bluntly put, we must clean up all this junk to enter IZUMO's dock for repairs

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:03.460
and to make room for them to load the necessary materials. Over.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.840
Oh, right.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:09.560
One of IZUMO's workers recently boarded ahead of the others.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.600
Really? It's gonna get lively, isn't it?

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.440
I'm going to remove the limiters.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.440
Is that okay?

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.490
Uh, Kimi?

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:23.450
This bonfire is kind of meant to be an offering...

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.200
And this is supposed to be a celebration...

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.240
That's precisely why!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.450
Okay!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.580
Hurry, hurry! Buy my rice and curry!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.790
Come on! You snooze, you lose!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.320
I've got England's famous Welsh wafer cakes!

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:42.330
They're almost expired,

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.120
so I'll throw in a 10% discount!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.120
Shirojiro, you're terrible!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.100
Welcome!

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:49.850
I'll take one.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.330
Happy birthday, Urqui!

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:54.480
Happy birthday!

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.840
I appreciate the wishes.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.610
Uh, so then,

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:01.060
here's a pile of erotic games with Big Sis types.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.680
Why am <i>I</i> giving it to him?

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.890
In fact, I shouldn't even touch these games for religious reasons.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.690
Here! Give him these, too!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.750
Fulfill your duty.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:13.620
Hey!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.500
Ah, Ohiroshiki!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.970
What've you done, you uncouth barbarian?!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.060
The games fell into the bonfire!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:19.820
Good grief...e bonfire!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:20.360
Good grief...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:21.380
Quick! Save them!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.380
So it's okay to have some hope, huh?

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:29.970
This is good!

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.350
It's everything I imagine Mikawa fowl to taste like.

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.000
Sir, I'll take another skewer!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.380
Wasn't that...?

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:42.190
So that's when I said, "You stay back!"

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:45.840
Lord Muneshige, how I wish to see you...

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.530
Try looking up?

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:50.910
Gin...

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.870
Lord Muneshige...?

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:55.620
Yes.

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:57.750
Why...?

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.430
Because, Gin,

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:01.250
don't you cry when you're alone?

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:05.810
I received word from the Chancellor that you had not come back yet,

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:11.880
so I cried, "Amore!" five times, ran through Hexagone Francaise and just arrived.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.770
But your inherited name has been revoked.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:17.450
I do not know what will become of me now...

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:19.970
Then why don't we both relinquish our inherited names?

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:27.150
Would you stay forever with a man whose inherited name of Tachibana Muneshige has been relinquished?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:30.150
What about you, Lord Muneshige?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:35.040
Do you want to be with an unsociable woman who is not the wife of Tachibana Muneshige?

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:36.690
No, I do not.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.050
Not unless I can be with you forever.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:46.860
Come to think of it,

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:50.010
this is the first time I've ever hugged you, isn't it?

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.940
Someday, once I am strong enough to be the true Peerless Man of the West

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.060
and succeed the name Tachibana Muneshige,

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.560
you will be my Tachibana Gin.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:04.620
Okay!

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:11.070
At any rate, President Sakai is doing the paperwork for you to transfer here.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.740
You'll be in the same class as Tenzo and I.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:15.790
Should I call you Queen Mary?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.580
You may call me Mary, Lady Masazumi.

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.100
Where is Musashi headed next?

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.490
First we'll undergo repairs in IZUMO,

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.300
after which I think we'll go by the M.H.R.R.

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:31.630
I want to investigate the apocalypse as well as Chancellor Carlos I.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:36.760
Oh, here it is, Mary. You'll be sharing the room with Tenzo.

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:37.390
Okay!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.830
Thank you very much.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:40.950
Later!

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.230
C-C-Come in!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.900
I'm coming in.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.230
Master Tenzo?

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:49.900
M-Master Mary, would you prefer to be on the top or bottom bunk?

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.490
We aren't sleeping together?

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.010
Well, the bunks are rather small...

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.700
Is that right?

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:02.160
Well, thank you for having me.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.080
Ah, er, I should say the same.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.470
Hold it, Master Mary! What on Earth are you doing?!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.620
I can't get any sleep unless I'm naked.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.360
Good night.

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:23.850
Master Mary...?

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:24.940
Yes?

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.530
I... I hope that I can become your scar.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.150
That is how I truly feel.

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:32.630
What are you talking about?

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:37.580
Master Tenzo, you've already hurt me as much as you've protected me!

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:43.960
I think I would like us to share our happiness together, Master Tenzo.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:51.920
Master Tori,

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:57.800
I know not whether I am right or wrong.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:01.590
However as long as I have you as my parallel,

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:05.560
I conclude that I shall maintain my place in the middle ground.

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:06.890
Judge.

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:08.560
That's about the same for me, too.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.270
From here out, we will retrieve my emotions

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:15.000
while investigating the apocalypse.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.450
Isn't that right, Master Tori?

00:22:18.220 --> 00:22:19.400
You okay with that?

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:39.630
Attention all citizens,

00:23:39.630 --> 00:23:44.070
this is a Quasi-Bahamut level announcement from Aerial Metropolitan Ship Musashi.

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:49.450
In order to repair damage to the ship, Musashi will be entering IZUMO's port momentarily.

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.620
Everyone, be sure to get plenty of rest and prepare for the next voyage. Over.
